{
  "schema": "openagents.coder-one.policy.v1",
  "name": "coder-one-microluna-oracle-live-on",
  "note": "The oracle arm of the pre-registered live oracle run (bench/terminal-bench/experiments/2026-09-25-oracle-live/protocol.md): the control arm with checks.oracle on at the tier 0 writer bounds (30 turns, 600 seconds, $0.08). The host writes the oracle before the trial and the loop uses the delivered copy. checks.oracle isn't admitted; validation accepts the switch only because the manifest names this registered experiment and its protocol's digest.",
  "policy": {
